# Written by `npm run setup` (convex dev); copy nothing by hand.
# CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=
# VITE_CONVEX_URL=
# VITE_CONVEX_SITE_URL=

# Sign-in's settings live on the Convex deployment, not here: see docs/setup.md.

# Healthchecks.io's ping address lives on the Convex deployment too, not here:
# `npx convex env set HEALTHCHECKS_PING_URL https://hc-ping.com/<ping key>` (convex/heartbeats/heartbeat.ts).
# Unset, the timed jobs ping nothing.
# Where the browser sends error reports (Sentry: Project Settings > Client Keys > DSN). Unset, the
# app reports nothing, as in dev and tests; set it in Vercel for the live site and previews.
# Vercel gives the build VITE_VERCEL_ENV and VITE_VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA itself, which name a
# report's environment and release.
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
